        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2fc9c1cf1b714727b846b84331f6ab6b",
      "statement": "The common OHLCV construction uses the first trade timestamp, first and last prices for open and close, extrema for high and low, summed volume, and row count; sampler-specific typed empty frames preserve a concrete schema when no bar is emitted.",
