      "statement": "Tick, volume, and dollar bars are fixed-activity samplers: they emit after a configured trade count, cumulative traded volume, or cumulative price-times-volume respectively, rather than on clock-time intervals; the default accelerated implementations identify ordered groups and aggregate them with Polars.",
