      "id": "claim_99f92830de1a4bf282b6ef472479b74b",
      "statement": "Window-based imbalance samplers wait for a full tick window, estimate expected bar length from a bounded window of recent completed bars, derive tick buy probability or mean signed volume from recent ticks, and emit only when the resulting expected imbalance is positive and reached.",
